{
  "description": "A stout, low-bodied quadruped shown in right-facing profile standing on a small patch of bare ground with sparse dry debris. The body is broad and rounded with a pale, smooth, faintly ridged underbelly and a dorsal surface densely covered in overlapping dark gray-brown scales from the top of the head across the back and sides to the tip of the tail. The head is broad, flat and blunt-snouted with a large round eye on the side, a small nostril, and a pale cream lower jaw and throat. Behind the head on both sides of the neck are several stalked, feathery external gills with fine filaments. Four thick, gray, muscular legs with bent joints support the body, each ending in a broad splayed foot, and a long, thick, tapering tail extends straight back behind the body, scaly above and pale below.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flattened and blunt-snouted with a rounded tip, small circular nostril near the snout tip, large prominent round eye on the side with a dark pupil and light iris and a slightly bulging eyelid, pale cream-colored lower jaw and throat contrasting with the darker top, and small overlapping rounded scales covering the crown and cheeks",
      "where": "at the front right end of the body, facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "feathery, branched external gills with a thick central stalk and dense fine filamentous fringes along both sides, gray-brown with pinkish-red fringes on the lower ones; five are visible",
      "where": "projecting outward from behind the head on both sides of the neck; three large gills on the near right side one above the other, and two smaller gills protruding above the dorsal midline on the far left side"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "dense, overlapping, keeled, rounded to slightly pointed scales, dark gray-brown with lighter edges giving a layered armored appearance; small and tightly packed on the top of the head, larger and more strongly keeled on the back, sides and tail",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal and lateral surface from the top of the head, across the back and sides, and over the dorsal surface of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four stout, thick, smooth-skinned gray limbs with visible bent elbow and knee joints and muscular upper segments",
      "where": "ventrolaterally under the body, two forelimbs under the chest and two hindlimbs under the rear, splayed outward to support the body above the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat, five-toed feet with short blunt toes each tipped with a small dark claw, skin gray and slightly wrinkled at the ankle",
      "where": "at the distal end of each leg, pressed flat against the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering to a blunt point, flattened slightly from side to side, covered dorsally with overlapping scales like the back and smooth pale cream ventrally with faint transverse ridges",
      "where": "extending horizontally straight back from the rear of the body to the right, behind the hind legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "strong countershading with dark gray-brown scaly dorsum and pale cream to off-white smooth venter and throat, no spots or stripes other than the scale pattern and the pale belly",
      "where": "over the whole body, dark on top and sides, pale on the underside, throat and ventral tail"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": ["axolotl", "pangolin", "salamander"],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0,
  "tails": 1
}
